@title Monorepo deployment pipeline
@subtitle Developer Productivity · Quillstone Software · as of 2026-10-10

# Pipeline diagram

diagram flow dir=LR title="Deployment pipeline"
flow: pr "Pull Request" user
flow: lint "Lint and Unit Tests" svc
flow: build "Build Image" svc
flow: scan "Security Scan" svc
flow: stg "Deploy to Staging" svc
flow: integ "Integration Tests" svc
flow: smoke "Smoke Tests" svc
flow: approve "Manual Approval" team
flow: canary "Canary 10%" svc
flow: full "Full Rollout" svc
flow: rollback "Auto Rollback" fn
flow: pr -> lint
flow: lint -> build : pass
flow: build -> scan
flow: scan -> stg : no critical CVEs
flow: stg -> integ
flow: integ -> smoke
flow: smoke -> approve : pass
flow: approve -> canary : approved
flow: canary -> full : healthy 30 min
flow: canary --> rollback : error rate above 1%

# Stage durations

data stages = Stage,Median (min),p90 (min); Lint and Unit Tests,7.5,13.4; Build Image,4.2,6.9; Security Scan,2.8,4.1; Deploy to Staging,3.1,5.0; Integration Tests,8.3,14.7;Smoke Tests,5.6,9.8; Canary 10%,30,30; Full Rollout,12,18

chart bar stages x=Stage y=Median (min) unit=min labels title="Median duration per stage (minutes)"

table stages

# Rules

- Manual Approval is required only for services tagged tier-1.
- Friday deploys after 15:00 local time are blocked.
- Auto Rollback pages the owning team.
